// AWS EC2 AMI Registered  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1525
// Detects registration of a new AMI (RegisterImage). A backdoored AMI used as a launch template provides durable persistence across new…
// False positives: Image bakery/golden-AMI pipelines.
// Source: rules/persistence/ec2-register-image.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "RegisterImage" and eventSource =~ "ec2.amazonaws.com"
